WEBVTT

00:13:26.665 --> 00:13:30.639
is so far away from our daily experiences
that it's kind of irrelevant.

00:13:31.363 --> 00:13:35.051
But the truth is
that this weird, slow life

00:13:35.075 --> 00:13:38.600
may actually have the answers
to some of the greatest mysteries

00:13:38.624 --> 00:13:39.774
of life on earth.

00:13:40.225 --> 00:13:41.376
Thank you.

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:46.444
(Applause)